# apps/web

- App Router under `src/app`. Alias `@/*` → `src/*`.
- UI components: `@/components/ui/*`; use `cn` from `@warden/ui`.
- Do not import `@warden/db` or `@prisma/client` in `src/`.
- Keep `vercel.json` `cd ../..` paths valid — do not move this app.
- Lint: `.eslintrc.json` + `next lint`. Env: `.env.local` from `.env.example`.
